            Aspergillus oryzae RIB40 genome consists of a nuclear genome
            assembly represented by eight chromosomes (assembled from 24
            entries) and three unplaced contigs (AP007156, AP007160 and
            AP007177) and a complete mitochondrial genome (AP007176).
